1
00:00:09,804 --> 00:00:15,220
Four states, and they are not
decoration: each one means something different is

2
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:15,563
true.

3
00:00:16,019 --> 00:00:22,016
A draft can still be changed by anybody
who can raise one — so it is marked as a

4
00:00:22,016 --> 00:00:26,514
draft wherever it appears,
including on the document itself.

5
00:00:26,965 --> 00:00:33,601
Issuing is the deliberate step. It fixes
the numbers and gives the document a place

6
00:00:33,601 --> 00:00:34,720
in your books.

7
00:00:35,172 --> 00:00:40,682
Now the watermark is gone, and what is
left is the thing you would actually send

8
00:00:40,682 --> 00:00:41,302
somebody.

9
00:00:41,757 --> 00:00:49,148
Sent is a fact about the post. Paid is a
fact about the bank. Neither is guessed

10
00:00:49,148 --> 00:00:50,534
from the other.

11
00:00:50,994 --> 00:00:56,288
Next: the bill that comes the
other way — what you pay us.

